note [E++ 1.3.5: animate a drawing cursor in the full Studio.]
add library "Draw"
define 'pencil' as drawing sprite
set the color of 'pencil' to "#c4b5fd"
set the speed of 'pencil' to 200
'pencil' move right "100"
'pencil' move down "100"
'pencil' move left "100"
'pencil' move up "100"

note [Lift the pen and switch to instant movement for a second cursor.]
let 'spark' be drawing sprite
set the speed of 'spark' to instant
lift the pen of 'spark'
'spark' move left "40"
lower the pen of 'spark'
'spark' move up "40"
say "Your drawing is ready!"
